# Public API Doc — New Endpoints

Add to the frontend docs:

### `GET /api/site-identity`

```json
{
  "site_type": "department",
  "site_title": "Department of Cyber Security",
  "site_tagline": "Securing the Digital Future",
  "site_logo_url": "https://pub-xxxx.r2.dev/branding/logo.webp",
  "university_name": "Dawood University of Engineering & Technology",
  "university_logo_url": "https://pub-xxxx.r2.dev/branding/duet-logo.webp",
  "favicon_url": "https://pub-xxxx.r2.dev/branding/favicon.ico",
  "primary_color": "#4c1d95",
  "meta_description": "Cyber Security Department — DUET",
  "updated_at": "2024-05-15 12:34:56"
}
```

Never returns `404`. If not configured, returns minimal defaults so the frontend can still render.

