### `GET /api/nav`

Returns the raw array as-is stored on the backedn and is customizable by the admin:

```json
[
  { "text": "Home", "href": "/home" },
  { "text": "About", "href": "/about" },
  { "text": "Faculty", "href": "/faculty" },
  { "text": "Societies", "id": "societies", "children": [
    { "text": "IEEE Education Society", "href": "/societies/ieee" }
  ]},
  { "text": "News", "href": "/news" },
  { "text": "Publications", "href": "/publications" },
  { "text": "SEA DB", "href": "/seadb", "external": true },
  { "text": "Contact", "href": "/contact" }
]
```
